WEBVTT

00:00:00.420 --> 00:00:03.050
Ever gotten a message that just says,

00:00:03.070 --> 00:00:04.450
can we talk tomorrow?

00:00:04.470 --> 00:00:07.300
And suddenly your brain starts preparing for a disaster

00:00:07.430 --> 00:00:09.240
that hasn't even happened yet?

00:00:09.520 --> 00:00:10.650
Here's the thing.

00:00:10.670 --> 00:00:13.350
Anxiety is your brain's alarm system.

00:00:13.370 --> 00:00:15.340
Its whole job is to protect you.

00:00:15.700 --> 00:00:18.490
Sometimes it just treats an ordinary moment like a five

00:00:18.610 --> 00:00:19.920
alarm emergency.
